= Tarkin's Terms

Wilhuff Tarkin has been dining at the Chancellery. The Security Bloc's hawks, who have little use for the Caucus, are being offered something better: a place at the right hand of [+ pal_name +], and a war run by people who mean to win it. If nothing changes, the Security Bloc will fold into Palpatine's following.
